WEBVTT

1
00:01:31,292 --> 00:01:33,492
<font color="#00ffcb"><b>PEMINDAI GEMA 203</b></font>

2
00:01:37,149 --> 00:01:38,949
<font color="#0affb1"><b>MU/TH/UR 9001 BANGUN</b></font>

3
00:01:44,149 --> 00:01:45,949
<font color="#0affb1"><b>TARGET MISI 
DITEMUKAN</b></font>

4
00:02:48,292 --> 00:02:49,692
<font color="#0affb1"><b>TARGET DIAMANKAN</b></font>

5
00:02:49,716 --> 00:02:51,116
<font color="#ccff00"><b>PROTOKOL PENGEMBALIAN
- DIMULAI -</b></font>

6
00:05:18,783 --> 00:05:20,483
Pekerja mohon perhatian.

7
00:05:20,485 --> 00:05:22,384
Pekerja mohon perhatian.

8
00:05:22,386 --> 00:05:25,621
15 menit lagi shift pagi dimulai.

9
00:05:25,623 --> 00:05:29,257
Para petani harap segera ke ruang makan.

10
00:05:29,259 --> 00:05:30,960
Jika ada yang merasa,

11
00:05:30,962 --> 00:05:32,595
demam, batuk,

12
00:05:32,597 --> 00:05:34,664
muntah atau sesak napas,

13
00:05:34,666 --> 00:05:37,332
silakan ke klinik untuk pemeriksaan.

14
00:05:38,470 --> 00:05:40,803
Keselamatan serta kesehatan koloni...

15
00:05:40,805 --> 00:05:43,675
adalah fokus utama Weyland-Yutani.

16
00:05:44,509 --> 00:05:46,409
Pekerja mohon perhatian...

17
00:05:46,411 --> 00:05:49,779
Pernah dengar astronot yang takut ruang sempit?

18
00:05:49,781 --> 00:05:50,913
Dia butuh ruang.

19
00:05:50,915 --> 00:05:52,815
Kumohon, berhentilah.

20
00:05:52,817 --> 00:05:56,819
Gajiku habis buat beli ikat pinggang
malah tak muat.

21
00:05:56,821 --> 00:05:58,386
Pinggang kebesaran.

22
00:05:58,388 --> 00:05:59,457
Lihat roti jagung itu.

23
00:06:01,893 --> 00:06:04,827
Mungkin karena aku lagi diet seafood.

24
00:06:04,829 --> 00:06:06,731
Ada makanan, langsung makan.

25
00:06:08,032 --> 00:06:09,699
Parah sekali.

26
00:06:09,701 --> 00:06:11,366
Dulu kau selalu tertawai soal itu.

27
00:06:11,368 --> 00:06:12,971
Saat aku masih 12 tahun.

28
00:06:17,509 --> 00:06:19,043
Kurasa itu Tn. Finch.

29
00:06:20,011 --> 00:06:21,746
Sudah 3 bulan kita menunggak.

30
00:06:22,981 --> 00:06:24,516
Dia pasti telepon lagi.

31
00:06:25,884 --> 00:06:29,819
Semoga saat itu kita sudah pergi.

32
00:06:36,761 --> 00:06:38,730
Andy, tetap didekatku.

33
00:06:41,666 --> 00:06:44,801
Sadar. Sadarlah sekarang.

34
00:06:44,803 --> 00:06:47,436
Kita ini budak Weyland-Yutani.

35
00:06:47,107 --> 00:06:48,707
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>Koloni tambang Start Jackson</b></font>

36
00:06:48,731 --> 00:06:49,731
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>Penghuni: 2781</b></font>

37
00:06:49,755 --> 00:06:50,955
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b> Jarak dari Bumi: 65 tahun cahaya</b></font>

38
00:06:50,979 --> 00:06:52,779
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>Sinar matahari per tahun: 0</b></font>

39
00:06:47,438 --> 00:06:49,839
Perusahaan memberi makan dan tempat tinggal,

40
00:06:49,841 --> 00:06:52,975
tapi nyawa kita jadi bayarannya.

41
00:06:52,977 --> 00:06:55,079
Jangan percaya kebohongan mereka.

42
00:06:55,747 --> 00:06:57,980
Mereka menguasai hidupmu!

43
00:06:57,982 --> 00:06:59,749
Andy. Hei.

44
00:06:59,751 --> 00:07:01,052
Andy. Ayo.

45
00:07:02,921 --> 00:07:05,054
- Memangnya kenapa?
- Itu penipuan.

46
00:07:05,056 --> 00:07:06,856
Cangkir yang kau pilih tak ada bolanya.

47
00:07:06,858 --> 00:07:07,990
Cuma tipuan.

48
00:07:07,992 --> 00:07:10,660
Tapi dari mana aku bisa dapat uang?

49
00:07:10,662 --> 00:07:11,627
Uang buat apa?

50
00:07:11,629 --> 00:07:15,765
Buat beli kuda di Yvaga nanti.

51
00:07:15,767 --> 00:07:17,700
Kau mau beli kuda?

52
00:07:17,702 --> 00:07:20,337
Aku mau kasih nama Raindy.

53
00:07:21,472 --> 00:07:22,974
Kau suka?

54
00:07:23,808 --> 00:07:25,508
- Raindy.
- Aku suka.

55
00:07:25,510 --> 00:07:27,078
Ya, bagus.

56
00:07:28,546 --> 00:07:31,514
Oke, tunggu di situ sebentar.

57
00:07:31,516 --> 00:07:32,717
Aku mungkin agak lama.

58
00:07:34,384 --> 00:07:35,918
Jangan cari masalah.

59
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:38,888
Semua pegawai akan dipanggil.

60
00:07:38,890 --> 00:07:40,056
Semoga berhasil.

61
00:07:40,058 --> 00:07:42,658
Antri yang tertib.

62
00:07:42,660 --> 00:07:44,026
Selanjutnya.

63
00:07:44,028 --> 00:07:45,995
Nama lengkap dan pekerjaan.

64
00:07:45,997 --> 00:07:49,532
Marie Raines Carradine, bu.
Petani.

65
00:07:49,534 --> 00:07:51,767
Ini soal surat perjalanan.

66
00:07:51,769 --> 00:07:54,472
Kuotaku sudah tercapai,
harusnya aku bisa pergi sekarang.

67
00:07:54,772 --> 00:07:55,938
Oke?

68
00:07:55,940 --> 00:07:57,440
Ke mana?

69
00:07:57,442 --> 00:07:59,075
Yvaga.

70
00:07:59,077 --> 00:08:03,412
Sistem itu independen, sudah diteraformasi.

71
00:08:03,414 --> 00:08:05,481
Di sana matahari terlihat jelas.

72
00:08:05,483 --> 00:08:06,818
Orang tuamu?

73
00:08:07,919 --> 00:08:11,454
Meninggal tiga siklus lalu.

74
00:08:11,456 --> 00:08:13,990
Penyakit paru-paru, dari tambang.

75
00:08:13,992 --> 00:08:16,759
Sekarang cuma aku dan saudaraku.

76
00:08:16,761 --> 00:08:19,963
Mereka tawarkan harapan agar kita terus jadi budak.

77
00:08:19,964 --> 00:08:25,737
Mereka tawarkan harapan agar kita 
terus jadi budak. Sadarlah sekarang.

78
00:08:36,948 --> 00:08:39,983
Maaf, tapi kau belum bisa bebas dari kontrak.

79
00:08:39,984 --> 00:08:41,083
Karena kekurangan pekerja,

80
00:08:41,085 --> 00:08:42,718
kau dipindahkan ke tambang.

81
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,654
Tunggu, apa?

82
00:08:44,656 --> 00:08:46,822
Tidak, aku sudah penuhi jamnya.

83
00:08:46,824 --> 00:08:48,290
Kalian harus bebaskan aku.

84
00:08:48,292 --> 00:08:51,160
Sayangnya, kuota dinaikkan jadi 24.000 jam,

85
00:08:51,162 --> 00:08:53,997
jadi kau baru bisa bebas 5 atau 6 tahun lagi.

86
00:08:53,998 --> 00:08:56,232
Terima kasih, dan ingat, perusahaan sangat...

87
00:08:56,234 --> 00:08:57,867
menghargai dedikasimu.

88
00:08:57,869 --> 00:09:00,102
- Rain!
- Hei!

89
00:09:00,104 --> 00:09:01,504
Berhenti!

90
00:09:01,506 --> 00:09:03,574
Tingalkan dia! Brengsek!

91
00:09:05,243 --> 00:09:07,176
Ada aku.

92
00:09:07,178 --> 00:09:08,613
Sial, kau berdarah.

93
00:09:11,215 --> 00:09:12,483
Oke.

94
00:09:13,718 --> 00:09:16,052
Tenang, kau aman.

95
00:09:16,054 --> 00:09:17,787
Aku akan meresetnya.

96
00:09:17,789 --> 00:09:18,823
Kau aman.

97
00:09:21,492 --> 00:09:22,758
Tenang saja.

98
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:24,128
Harusnya aku tetap bersamamu.

99
00:09:29,734 --> 00:09:33,270
Mereka tawarkan harapan
agar kita terus jadi budak.

100
00:09:33,271 --> 00:09:35,540
Sadarlah sekarang.
Mereka mengatur hidupmu.

101
00:09:38,403 --> 00:09:39,602
Hai, Rain.

102
00:09:39,604 --> 00:09:41,270
Maaf, aku sudah telepon seharian.

103
00:09:41,272 --> 00:09:42,805
tapi ada yang penting..

104
00:09:42,807 --> 00:09:44,474
dan kau harus tahu.

105
00:09:44,476 --> 00:09:47,145
Jadi, datanglah ke trailer dan bawa Andy.

106
00:10:17,375 --> 00:10:18,410
Hei.

107
00:10:19,444 --> 00:10:20,610
Karena...

108
00:10:20,612 --> 00:10:22,578
Permainan selesai.

109
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:25,515
Apa kabar, Rain?
Lama tak bertemu.

110
00:10:25,517 --> 00:10:27,218
Sudah kubilang dia pasti datang.

111
00:10:27,786 --> 00:10:29,187
Kau berutang 5$.

112
00:10:30,321 --> 00:10:31,456
Andy!

113
00:10:34,359 --> 00:10:36,526
Kenapa penambang buta itu jatuh ke sumur?

114
00:10:36,528 --> 00:10:37,829
Kenapa?

115
00:10:39,731 --> 00:10:41,332
Karena dia tak bisa lihat sumur itu.

116
00:10:41,966 --> 00:10:44,233
Jangan kasih semangat dia.

117
00:10:44,235 --> 00:10:46,204
Masuklah dulu.
Nanti aku ke situ.

118
00:10:52,010 --> 00:10:53,576
- Kay.
- Rain.

119
00:10:53,578 --> 00:10:54,744
- Hai.
- Hai!

120
00:10:54,746 --> 00:10:55,847
Hai.

121
00:10:56,748 --> 00:10:58,715
Aku kangen.

122
00:10:58,717 --> 00:11:00,618
Aku tahu kakakku juga merindukanmu.

123
00:11:05,356 --> 00:11:07,292
Aku senang sekali kau datang.

124
00:11:08,626 --> 00:11:10,793
Aku dengar soal ayahmu.

125
00:11:10,795 --> 00:11:11,830
Aku turut berduka.

126
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:15,965
Antara badai es
dan penyakit wabah baru di setiap siklus...

127
00:11:15,967 --> 00:11:17,767
Semua orang mati, kan?

128
00:11:17,769 --> 00:11:19,504
Jadi, tunjukkan ke dia?

129
00:11:19,871 --> 00:11:21,604
Tunjukan apa?

130
00:11:21,606 --> 00:11:24,640
Oke, tadi malam,

131
00:11:24,642 --> 00:11:26,309
saat kami angkut Tesotek terakhir,

132
00:11:26,311 --> 00:11:28,977
kami berada 200 mil di atas permukaan,
dan tiba-tiba...

133
00:11:30,682 --> 00:11:32,315
Pengangkut menangkap sinyal ini.

134
00:11:32,317 --> 00:11:34,450
Navarro melacaknya, dan ternyata...

135
00:11:34,452 --> 00:11:37,422
ada kapal Wey-Yu besar mengambang di atas kami.

136
00:11:37,422 --> 00:11:38,554
Mengambang?

137
00:11:38,556 --> 00:11:40,389
Tak beroperasi. Ditinggalkan.

138
00:11:40,391 --> 00:11:42,492
Kapal tua.
Mungkin sudah rusak atau tak terpakai lagi.

139
00:11:42,494 --> 00:11:43,793
Seperti orang itu.

140
00:11:43,795 --> 00:11:44,829
Bjorn.

141
00:11:46,065 --> 00:11:48,564
Oke, katakan saja.

142
00:11:48,566 --> 00:11:50,366
Untu apa kita buang-buang waktu...

143
00:11:50,368 --> 00:11:54,003
menunggu izin perjalanan
yang tak bakal diberikan perusahaan?

144
00:11:54,005 --> 00:11:56,306
Karena pengangkut itu cukup kuat
mengantar kita ke Yvaga.

145
00:11:56,307 --> 00:11:59,408
Karena butuh 9 tahun untuk sampai ke Yvaga,

146
00:11:59,410 --> 00:12:01,611
dan kau butuh cryo-sleep untuk bisa sampai.

147
00:12:01,613 --> 00:12:04,415
Kapal yang tak terpakai biasanya
punya banyak peralatan yang berfungsi.

148
00:12:04,415 --> 00:12:05,848
Dan dari hyperlink...

149
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:07,719
kapal itu masih punya beberapa pod.

150
00:12:11,556 --> 00:12:14,924
Serius mau mencuri peralatan dari kapal....

151
00:12:14,926 --> 00:12:17,527
Weyland-Yutani yang dijaga ketat?

152
00:12:17,529 --> 00:12:19,228
Sebelum ada yang dahului kita.

153
00:12:20,632 --> 00:12:21,931
Kalian gila.

154
00:12:21,933 --> 00:12:23,366
- Kami gila.
- Tidak, kita tak gila.

155
00:12:23,368 --> 00:12:24,667
- Ini...
- Itu yang kumaksud.

156
00:12:24,669 --> 00:12:25,870
Mau ikut bantu?

157
00:12:27,933 --> 00:12:29,801
Maaf, kenapa butuh aku?

158
00:12:31,903 --> 00:12:33,236
Andy.

159
00:12:33,238 --> 00:12:35,105
- Kita butuh Andy.
- Andy?

160
00:12:35,107 --> 00:12:36,306


161
00:12:36,308 --> 00:12:39,042
Dia robot Weyland-Yutani.
Dia mengerti bahasa "Mother."

162
00:12:39,044 --> 00:12:42,146
Dia bisa akses terminal kapal itu
untuk keluar masuk tanpa masalah.

163
00:12:42,147 --> 00:12:43,480
Cuma itu caranya.

164
00:12:43,482 --> 00:12:45,683
Tapi kalau kita ketahuan?

165
00:12:45,685 --> 00:12:48,385
Kita tak akan bakalan dapat izin perjalanan.

166
00:12:48,387 --> 00:12:50,253
Baik, Rain tak mau ikut.

167
00:12:50,255 --> 00:12:53,189
Bagaimana kalau Andy ikut kami?

168
00:12:53,191 --> 00:12:56,292
Aku tak mau adikku ke sana sendirian.

169
00:12:56,294 --> 00:12:57,460
Dia bukan adikmu, kan?

170
00:12:57,462 --> 00:12:59,697
- Bjorn, diamlah.
- Tapi benar, kan?

171
00:12:59,699 --> 00:13:01,231
Dia bukan adikmu.
Cuma barang rusak Wey-Yu...

172
00:13:01,233 --> 00:13:02,932
ditemukan ayahmu di tempat sampah.

173
00:13:02,934 --> 00:13:04,871
Begitulah dia, Rain.
Jadi sadarlah.

174
00:13:05,404 --> 00:13:06,503
Ayo.

175
00:13:06,505 --> 00:13:07,470
- Rain?
- Apa?

176
00:13:07,472 --> 00:13:10,573
- Aku tak bilang apa-apa.
- Rain, tunggu.

177
00:13:10,575 --> 00:13:13,011
Maaf, aku tahu sepupuku
memang menyebalkan.

178
00:13:13,011 --> 00:13:14,579
Tapi soal ini, dia benar.

179
00:13:15,313 --> 00:13:16,647
Kau harus sadar.

180
00:13:16,649 --> 00:13:17,715
Karena perusahaan ini...

181
00:13:17,717 --> 00:13:18,816
tak akan memberi kita apa-apa.

182
00:13:18,818 --> 00:13:21,184
Kau juga tahu sama sepertiku.
Kita harus ambil kesempatan itu.

183
00:13:25,223 --> 00:13:27,090
Rain, aku cuma...

184
00:13:27,092 --> 00:13:29,327
Aku tak mau bernasib seperti orang tua kita.

185
00:13:29,494 --> 00:13:30,696
Kau mau?

186
00:13:35,701 --> 00:13:40,303
Sebegitu mudahkah rencanamu ini?

187
00:13:40,305 --> 00:13:42,572
Kau tak perlu keluar dari Corbelan.

188
00:13:42,574 --> 00:13:44,376
Aku janji soal itu, oke?

189
00:13:48,447 --> 00:13:50,048
Ayo, kau ikut?

190
00:14:14,306 --> 00:14:15,974
Bjorn, cepat, ayo.

191
00:14:20,078 --> 00:14:23,014
Baik, aku hidupkan.
Baterai nyala.

192
00:14:25,383 --> 00:14:26,218
Bagus.

193
00:14:26,917 --> 00:14:28,671
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>RUANG KARGO</b></font>

194
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:29,488
Tolong nyalakan hidro.

195
00:14:29,915 --> 00:14:31,468
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>RUANG GANTI</b></font>

196
00:14:30,589 --> 00:14:31,624
Panel komunikasi.

197
00:14:33,461 --> 00:14:34,881
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>KORIDOR</b></font>

198
00:14:33,592 --> 00:14:34,758
Sistem pendaratan aktif.

199
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:36,061
Mereka sudah siap.

200
00:14:36,796 --> 00:14:38,228
Baru pertama ke angkasa?

201
00:14:38,230 --> 00:14:39,264
Ya.

202
00:14:40,465 --> 00:14:42,800
Kau juga?

203
00:14:42,802 --> 00:14:45,068
- Pompa bahan bakar.
- Nyala.

204
00:14:45,070 --> 00:14:46,135
Dua pemula luar angkasa lagi lewat.

205
00:14:46,137 --> 00:14:48,605
Lihatlah ke luar jendela,

206
00:14:48,607 --> 00:14:50,710
karena sepertinya kita takkan kembali.

207
00:15:04,189 --> 00:15:05,355
Kau siap?

208
00:15:05,357 --> 00:15:06,391
Aku siap.

209
00:15:07,359 --> 00:15:08,893
Semuanya akan baik-baik saja.

210
00:15:27,713 --> 00:15:29,345
Yakin ini ide bagus?

211
00:15:29,347 --> 00:15:30,448
Yakin, Ayah.

212
00:15:36,121 --> 00:15:37,222
Bersiaplah hentakan datang.

213
00:15:56,341 --> 00:15:57,677
Begitulah caranya.

214
00:16:54,165 --> 00:16:55,200
Itu...

215
00:16:56,601 --> 00:16:57,935
Ya.

216
00:16:57,937 --> 00:16:59,705
Itu matahari kita.

217
00:17:11,817 --> 00:17:14,685
Katanya senja di Yvaga adalah yang terindah.

218
00:17:14,687 --> 00:17:16,254
Aku pernah melihatnya.

219
00:17:18,958 --> 00:17:21,224
Dalam mimpi.

220
00:17:21,226 --> 00:17:23,261
Tak sabar melihatnya bersamamu.

221
00:17:26,598 --> 00:17:27,633
Ya.

222
00:17:30,670 --> 00:17:32,670
Katanya tidur kriogenik
membuat waktu bertahun-tahun...

223
00:17:32,672 --> 00:17:34,437
terasa seperti semalam setelah mabuk berat.

224
00:17:34,439 --> 00:17:36,808
Jadi, saat kita bangun di Yvaga besok,

225
00:17:37,542 --> 00:17:39,477
rasanya kayak mabuk berat.

226
00:17:48,386 --> 00:17:49,521
Itu dia.

227
00:17:51,757 --> 00:17:53,291
Itu bukan kapal.

228
00:17:53,558 --> 00:17:55,726
Tidak.

229
00:17:55,728 --> 00:17:57,661
Sialan, besar sekali.
Apa itu?

230
00:17:57,663 --> 00:17:59,797
Pos luar yang tak terpakai lagi?
Entahlah.

231
00:17:59,799 --> 00:18:01,464
Mungkin terseret ke orbit kita.

232
00:18:01,466 --> 00:18:03,533
Oke, Navarro, dekati perlahan.

233
00:18:03,535 --> 00:18:05,603
Oke, akan kusamakan putarannya.

234
00:18:21,954 --> 00:18:24,690
Peringatan bahaya mendekat.

235
00:18:25,958 --> 00:18:27,024
Ada apa?

236
00:18:27,026 --> 00:18:29,561
Sabuknya lebih dekat dari yang kukira.

237
00:18:31,463 --> 00:18:32,497
Berapa lama lagi?

238
00:18:33,899 --> 00:18:35,666
Kurang lebih 36 jam.

239
00:18:35,668 --> 00:18:36,667
Sebelum kapan?

240
00:18:36,669 --> 00:18:39,737
Sebelum stasiun menabrak cincin planet.

241
00:18:39,739 --> 00:18:41,805
Maaf, apa?

242
00:18:41,807 --> 00:18:44,273
Kau bilang apa?
Bukan pertanda baik.

243
00:18:44,275 --> 00:18:45,508
36 jam.

244
00:18:45,510 --> 00:18:47,012
Kita hanya butuh 30 menit.

245
00:18:47,947 --> 00:18:49,512
Ya?

246
00:18:49,514 --> 00:18:50,647
Andy.

247
00:18:50,649 --> 00:18:52,348
Paling lama.

248
00:18:52,350 --> 00:18:54,586
Yakin mau melakukannya?

249
00:18:55,654 --> 00:18:58,454
Tugas utamaku hanya satu.

250
00:18:58,456 --> 00:19:00,325
Melakukan yang terbaik demi Rain.

251
00:19:01,459 --> 00:19:03,261
Ayahmu yang menulisnya.

252
00:19:03,763 --> 00:19:04,797
Ya.

253
00:19:05,831 --> 00:19:07,698
Juga terlalu banyak lelucon ayah.

254
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:09,034
Aku senang...

255
00:19:09,935 --> 00:19:11,302
bisa membantu.

256
00:19:16,341 --> 00:19:17,777
Berhati-hatilah.

257
00:19:33,859 --> 00:19:35,694
Cepatlah.
Kita sampai 2 menit lagi.

258
00:19:38,030 --> 00:19:39,395
Pakai ini.

259
00:19:39,397 --> 00:19:40,931
Kenapa harus pakai ini?

260
00:19:40,933 --> 00:19:42,498
Agar kau tidak kedinginan.

261
00:19:42,500 --> 00:19:45,070
Hentikan kebiasaan anehmu itu.
Tak baik.

262
00:19:45,070 --> 00:19:46,302
Bicara lagi, akan kulepas.

263
00:19:46,304 --> 00:19:48,604
Kau memang menginginkannya, kan?

264
00:19:48,606 --> 00:19:49,907
Mau kutunjukkan, tidak?

265
00:19:49,909 --> 00:19:51,340
Diam sebentar.

266
00:19:51,342 --> 00:19:53,110
Sarung tangan, ini, pakai.

267
00:19:53,112 --> 00:19:55,679
Tidak.
Jangan sentuh apa pun.

268
00:19:55,681 --> 00:19:56,914
- Sini.
- Bjorn, biarkan dia,

269
00:19:56,916 --> 00:19:58,949
sialan

270
00:19:58,951 --> 00:20:00,349
Andy, abaikan saja.

271
00:20:00,351 --> 00:20:01,417
Baiklah, tapi bukan salahku...

272
00:20:01,419 --> 00:20:02,887
jika ada yang rusak.

273
00:20:10,361 --> 00:20:12,730
Ada pintu sintetis di depan.
Aku akan sandarkan.

274
00:20:12,731 --> 00:20:14,066
Baiklah.
Masuk pelan-pelan.

275
00:20:41,060 --> 00:20:42,661
Dingin sekali di sini.

276
00:20:43,428 --> 00:20:44,695
Apa itu?

277
00:20:44,697 --> 00:20:46,897
Pemindai suhu.

278
00:20:46,899 --> 00:20:48,566
Ini akan memandu kita ke pod.

279
00:20:50,870 --> 00:20:52,903
Oke, kompresinya cukup.

280
00:20:52,905 --> 00:20:55,005
Oksigennya sangat sedikit untuk dihirup.

281
00:20:55,007 --> 00:20:56,439
Andy,

282
00:20:56,441 --> 00:20:57,841
giliranmu.

283
00:20:57,843 --> 00:20:59,144
Saatnya unjuk gigi.

284
00:21:05,150 --> 00:21:07,017
Ya! Andy!

285
00:21:07,019 --> 00:21:08,120
Kerja bagus.

286
00:21:08,621 --> 00:21:09,688
Oke.

287
00:21:11,757 --> 00:21:13,158
Selamat, kau bukan pemula lagi.

288
00:21:14,492 --> 00:21:15,526
Baik.

289
00:21:26,038 --> 00:21:27,472
Ayo.

290
00:21:59,705 --> 00:22:00,904
Sialan.

291
00:22:00,906 --> 00:22:03,040
Teman-teman,
kita masuk ke zona tanpa gravitasi.

292
00:22:03,042 --> 00:22:04,777
Ya, terasa di perutku.

293
00:22:10,149 --> 00:22:11,480
Tunggu, apa itu?

294
00:22:11,482 --> 00:22:12,749
Generator gravitasi.

295
00:22:12,751 --> 00:22:15,719
Meski mati, sistem pembersihan
masih berjalan secara berkala.

296
00:22:15,721 --> 00:22:17,656
Mencegah tempat ini meledak.

297
00:22:21,393 --> 00:22:23,762
Sialan, perutku kambuh lagi.

298
00:22:24,697 --> 00:22:26,398
Oke, lurus saja.

299
00:23:03,235 --> 00:23:04,668
Menurut pemindai,

300
00:23:04,670 --> 00:23:06,471
pod ada di dalam sini.

301
00:23:34,633 --> 00:23:35,966
Astaga.

302
00:23:35,968 --> 00:23:37,200
Andy, kau baik saja?

303
00:23:37,202 --> 00:23:38,303
Ya.

304
00:23:44,403 --> 00:23:46,972
Ya, kabar baik, pod terlihat.

305
00:23:51,677 --> 00:23:52,712
Sialan!

306
00:23:55,915 --> 00:23:57,482
Bjorn, kau baik saja?

307
00:23:57,917 --> 00:23:59,717
Sialan!

308
00:23:59,719 --> 00:24:01,652
Sepertinya tulang ekorku retak.

309
00:24:06,459 --> 00:24:08,894
Sialan. Jangan main-main
dengan pelepasan gravitasi.

310
00:24:15,120 --> 00:24:16,720
<font color="#ccff00"><b>SISTEM DIAKTIFKAN</b></font>

311
00:24:24,710 --> 00:24:27,014
Syukurlah, masih ada energi di mesin tua ini.

312
00:24:43,329 --> 00:24:45,863
Hati-hati, gravitasi akan kembali.

313
00:24:45,865 --> 00:24:48,367
Sialan.

314
00:24:54,940 --> 00:24:56,874
Oke, ayo mulai.

315
00:24:56,876 --> 00:24:58,043
Kita lihat apa yang ada.

316
00:24:59,411 --> 00:25:00,513
Oke.

317
00:25:04,984 --> 00:25:07,885
- Sial.
- Ada masalah?

318
00:25:07,887 --> 00:25:09,486
Pod-nya kekurangan bahan bakar.

319
00:25:09,488 --> 00:25:10,788
Maksudmu apa?

320
00:25:10,790 --> 00:25:12,589
Bahan bakarnya cuma untuk 3 tahun stasis.

321
00:25:12,591 --> 00:25:14,959
Tapi butuh 9 tahun sampai ke Yvaga.

322
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:16,660
Ya, aku tahu.

323
00:25:16,662 --> 00:25:18,061
Sialan.

324
00:25:18,063 --> 00:25:19,596
Sudah kuduga.

325
00:25:19,598 --> 00:25:20,731
- Aku tahu.
- Tenanglah.

326
00:25:20,733 --> 00:25:21,832
Mungkin kalian harus kembali.

327
00:25:21,834 --> 00:25:23,368
Tidak, jangan menyerah sekarang.

328
00:25:25,437 --> 00:25:29,507
Yvaga adalah sistem terdekat.
Sekarang kita harus bagaimana?

329
00:25:29,508 --> 00:25:31,642
- Kita harus bagaimana?
- Diam.

330
00:25:31,644 --> 00:25:34,611
Ada sinyal kuat.
Pasti ada depot kryo dekat sini.

331
00:25:34,613 --> 00:25:36,547
Bahan bakarnya bisa kita temukan di sana.

332
00:25:36,549 --> 00:25:39,783
Navarro, aku keluarkan EEV.

333
00:25:39,785 --> 00:25:40,851
Ayo, Andy.

334
00:25:40,853 --> 00:25:43,288
Kalian urus itu,
kami cari bahan bakarnya.

335
00:26:03,008 --> 00:26:04,043
Sebentar.

336
00:26:05,411 --> 00:26:07,112
365m lagi, lurus saja.

337
00:26:08,781 --> 00:26:09,913
Kenapa harus pakai cara militer?

338
00:26:09,915 --> 00:26:11,014
Apa?

339
00:26:11,016 --> 00:26:11,949
Semua gaya militermu itu.

340
00:26:11,951 --> 00:26:14,852
- Itu efektif.
- Benarkah?

341
00:26:14,854 --> 00:26:15,986
- Dan keren.
- Tidak terlalu keren.

342
00:26:15,988 --> 00:26:17,988
Kau cuma tampak bego.

343
00:26:17,990 --> 00:26:19,489
- Maaf.
- Oke, tenanglah.

344
00:26:19,491 --> 00:26:20,757
Ayo terus bergerak.

345
00:26:20,759 --> 00:26:21,825
Jika kau ulangi lagi, kuhajar kau.

346
00:26:21,827 --> 00:26:22,893
- Bjorn, diam kau!
- Mengerti?

347
00:26:22,895 --> 00:26:24,962
Asal dia tak menghalangi jalanku.

348
00:26:24,964 --> 00:26:27,598
Kenapa dia begitu kasar?

349
00:26:27,600 --> 00:26:30,434
Karena insiden yang menimpa ibunya.

350
00:26:30,436 --> 00:26:31,969
- Maksudmu apa?
- Siklus lalu,

351
00:26:31,971 --> 00:26:33,704
ada kebocoran gas di tambang,

352
00:26:33,706 --> 00:26:35,839
dan sintetik menutup area itu,

353
00:26:35,841 --> 00:26:37,741
meski ibunya Bjorn terjebak di sana.

354
00:26:37,743 --> 00:26:39,009
Apa?

355
00:26:39,011 --> 00:26:40,744
Sintetik tak bisa mencelakai manusia.

356
00:26:40,746 --> 00:26:43,782
Tiga penambang dikorbankan
agar belasan lainnya selamat.

357
00:26:45,918 --> 00:26:47,486
Itu, bisa mereka lakukan.

358
00:26:52,691 --> 00:26:53,826
Mengerikan.

359
00:27:38,604 --> 00:27:40,839
Aku mendapatkanmu.

360
00:27:42,574 --> 00:27:44,476
Ayo.

361
00:27:46,011 --> 00:27:47,713
Pelan-pelan.

362
00:27:52,618 --> 00:27:53,953
Bagus.

363
00:27:58,757 --> 00:27:59,792
Kay!

364
00:28:00,793 --> 00:28:02,259
Kay!  Hei.

365
00:28:02,261 --> 00:28:04,161
Hei.

366
00:28:04,163 --> 00:28:05,929
Aku di sini.
Kau tak apa.

367
00:28:06,099 --> 00:28:08,098
Aku mau periksa podnya.

368
00:28:26,051 --> 00:28:27,953
Tidak. Jangan khawatir.

369
00:28:28,854 --> 00:28:30,620
Aku tidak sakit.

370
00:28:30,622 --> 00:28:31,657
Terus ada apa?

371
00:28:33,293 --> 00:28:34,693
Tidak ada apa-apa.

372
00:28:38,097 --> 00:28:39,598
Astaga.

373
00:28:42,601 --> 00:28:43,669
Siapa ayahnya?

374
00:28:44,870 --> 00:28:46,105
Seorang bajingan.

375
00:28:48,040 --> 00:28:51,243
Jangan bilang ke kakakku, oke?

376
00:28:52,644 --> 00:28:54,077
Dia sudah cukup punya beban.

377
00:28:54,079 --> 00:28:56,546
Aku tak akan bilang.

378
00:28:56,548 --> 00:28:59,251
Aku senang bayi ini akan melihat matahari.

379
00:29:13,377 --> 00:29:16,377
<font color="#ccff00"><b>PERUSAHAAN WEYLAND - YUTANI
Membangun Dunia Yang Lebih Baik</b></font>

380
00:29:22,041 --> 00:29:23,642
Sepertinya sudah mau sampai.

381
00:29:28,013 --> 00:29:29,679
Oke, Navarro.

382
00:29:29,681 --> 00:29:32,217
Airlock 5-B,  jalur keluar kita
saat bahan bakar kriogenik ditemukan.

383
00:29:32,217 --> 00:29:33,183
Dalam perjalanan.

384
00:29:33,185 --> 00:29:36,155
Selamat datang
di Stasiun Luar Angkasa Renaissance,

385
00:29:36,155 --> 00:29:40,690
pusat Penelitian dan Pengembangan Weyland-Yutani.

386
00:29:40,567 --> 00:29:41,967
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>Romulus dan Remus, saudara kembar</b></font>

387
00:29:41,991 --> 00:29:43,491
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>dari Dewa Perang dan Perawan Vesta,</b></font>

388
00:29:43,515 --> 00:29:44,515
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>dengan ikatan yang abadi.</b></font>

389
00:29:40,692 --> 00:29:43,960
Stasiun ini terbagi dua,

390
00:29:43,962 --> 00:29:45,798
Romulus dan Remus,

391
00:29:46,965 --> 00:29:49,933
yang didedikasikan untuk misi memperkuat...

392
00:29:49,935 --> 00:29:52,004
peran manusia di luar angkasa.

393
00:29:54,773 --> 00:29:57,874
Tempat ini bikin bulu kudukku merinding.

394
00:29:57,876 --> 00:30:00,846
Pernah dengar tentang penambang
yang kehilangan sebelah kirinya?

395
00:30:02,315 --> 00:30:03,647
Dia baik-baik saja sekarang.

396
00:30:03,649 --> 00:30:05,115
Mengerti?  Dia baik-baik saja.

397
00:30:05,117 --> 00:30:06,919
Bisa diam tidak?

398
00:30:08,020 --> 00:30:09,653
Kau bilang gugup,

399
00:30:09,655 --> 00:30:10,654
aku cuma mau memastikanmu...

400
00:30:10,656 --> 00:30:13,957
Astaga! Aku tak sabar masuk ke pod...

401
00:30:13,959 --> 00:30:15,794
agar aku tak melihatmu lagi.

402
00:30:17,863 --> 00:30:19,763
Kau akan melihatku di Yvaga.

403
00:30:19,765 --> 00:30:21,164
Kau tidak akan ke Yvaga.

404
00:30:21,166 --> 00:30:22,302
Bjorn, berhenti!

405
00:30:22,935 --> 00:30:24,134
Aku tak ikut?

406
00:30:24,136 --> 00:30:25,268
Bagus.

407
00:30:25,270 --> 00:30:27,338
Dia tak memberitahumu?

408
00:30:27,340 --> 00:30:30,209
Itu bukan wilayah Weyland-Yutani,

409
00:30:31,777 --> 00:30:33,645
jadi orang palsu tak diperbolehkan.

410
00:30:34,534 --> 00:30:37,069
Aku lebih suka disebut "manusia buatan."

411
00:30:39,472 --> 00:30:41,438
Andy, dengar.

412
00:30:41,440 --> 00:30:42,741
Rain bisa dipenjara...

413
00:30:42,743 --> 00:30:43,708
kalau dia pergi bersamamu.

414
00:30:43,710 --> 00:30:45,276
Jika kalian tinggal di Jackson,

415
00:30:45,278 --> 00:30:46,610
cepat atau lambat...

416
00:30:46,612 --> 00:30:48,715
perusahaan akan menonaktifkanmu lagi.

417
00:30:49,415 --> 00:30:51,448
Mengerti?

418
00:30:51,450 --> 00:30:53,419
Kau harus jaga pod di kapal.

419
00:30:54,253 --> 00:30:55,454
Begitu kami tiba...

420
00:30:56,723 --> 00:30:58,222
Dinonaktifkan.

421
00:30:58,224 --> 00:30:59,756
Tidak akan aktif lagi.

422
00:31:00,794 --> 00:31:02,293
Sudah selesai?

423
00:31:02,295 --> 00:31:03,462
Aku cuma jujur.

424
00:31:07,199 --> 00:31:09,533
Tak apa.

425
00:31:09,535 --> 00:31:12,773
Jika itu yang terbaik buat Rain,
itu juga terbaik buatku.

426
00:31:16,642 --> 00:31:18,477
Kau orang baik, Andy.

427
00:31:19,746 --> 00:31:21,547
Semua bakal merindukanmu.

428
00:31:26,887 --> 00:31:28,221
Jadi dia tak tahu?

429
00:31:29,488 --> 00:31:32,291
Aku tidak tega memberitahunya.

430
00:31:34,193 --> 00:31:35,461
Jangan merasa bersalah.

431
00:31:37,864 --> 00:31:39,229
Sial.

432
00:31:39,231 --> 00:31:42,236
Jangan sia-siakan hidupmu cuma demi Andy.

433
00:31:44,337 --> 00:31:46,873
Dia tak peduli.
Itu tak berarti baginya.

434
00:31:48,641 --> 00:31:50,242
Dia bukan...

435
00:31:51,344 --> 00:31:52,879
manusia sungguhan.

436
00:32:16,703 --> 00:32:18,571
Asal sinyalnya dari sini.

437
00:32:28,414 --> 00:32:30,749
Katanya tempat ini sudah tak terpakai.

438
00:32:30,751 --> 00:32:32,784
Ya.

439
00:32:32,786 --> 00:32:34,786
Sepertinya masih terpakai.

440
00:32:34,788 --> 00:32:36,253
Benar.

441
00:32:36,255 --> 00:32:38,489
Tapi jelas tak berpenghuni.

442
00:32:38,491 --> 00:32:41,425
Andy, lihat ini.

443
00:32:41,427 --> 00:32:43,529
Aku bisa melumpuhkan sintetik ini...

444
00:32:44,330 --> 00:32:45,897
jika daya listriknya ditambah.

445
00:32:49,435 --> 00:32:50,869
Mungkin kubawa saja.

446
00:32:50,871 --> 00:32:51,870
Sudah cukup.

447
00:32:51,872 --> 00:32:54,173
Jaga-jaga jika ada niat aneh.

448
00:32:55,274 --> 00:32:58,375
Tenang, aku cuma bercanda.

449
00:32:58,377 --> 00:32:59,412
Apa-apaan ini?

450
00:32:59,780 --> 00:33:01,114
Hati-Hati.

451
00:33:11,457 --> 00:33:12,558
Sial.

452
00:33:17,496 --> 00:33:19,029
Cuma sintetik.

453
00:33:20,599 --> 00:33:22,566
Sialan.

454
00:33:22,568 --> 00:33:24,703
Tadi kukira itu manusia beneran.

455
00:33:24,705 --> 00:33:26,370
Apa yang terjadi di situ?

456
00:33:26,372 --> 00:33:28,240
Entah.
Mungkin ada kebocoran bahan kimia.

457
00:33:29,341 --> 00:33:30,340
Bahan bakarnya pasti di ruangan itu.

458
00:33:30,342 --> 00:33:31,978
Ayo ambil dan pergi.

459
00:33:37,583 --> 00:33:39,385
Oke. Andy?

460
00:33:53,834 --> 00:33:55,501
Bjorn, pegang senternya.

461
00:34:00,339 --> 00:34:02,339
Sepertinya tidak ada pod di sini.

462
00:34:02,341 --> 00:34:03,708
Cuma alat pendingin.

463
00:34:03,710 --> 00:34:05,478
Tapi bahan bakarnya sama.

464
00:34:11,718 --> 00:34:12,753
Ya.

465
00:34:14,487 --> 00:34:15,954
45 kilo.

466
00:34:15,956 --> 00:34:18,957
Lebih dari cukup tiba ke Yvaga.

467
00:34:18,959 --> 00:34:21,393
Bjorn, bantu aku angkat ini.

468
00:34:30,804 --> 00:34:32,737
Bjorn, tarik di hitungan tiga.

469
00:34:32,739 --> 00:34:33,938
Siap?

470
00:34:33,940 --> 00:34:35,341
Satu, dua...

471
00:34:36,408 --> 00:34:37,574
tiga.

472
00:34:37,576 --> 00:34:38,843
Sialan!

473
00:34:38,845 --> 00:34:40,046
- Sialan.
- Jariku.

474
00:34:41,882 --> 00:34:43,416
Jariku mati rasa.

475
00:34:50,924 --> 00:34:52,724
Sakitnya.
Tanganku serasa beku.

476
00:34:52,726 --> 00:34:54,491
- Apa yang terjadi?
- Sialan.

477
00:34:54,493 --> 00:34:56,795
Tidak tahu.
Sepertinya ini penguncian darurat.

478
00:34:56,797 --> 00:34:58,364
Andy, pintunya.

479
00:35:00,666 --> 00:35:02,166
{\an8}<font color="#ccff00"><b>HUBUNGI PETUGAS SAINS</b></font>

480
00:35:01,868 --> 00:35:03,367
Sial, aksesnya ditolak.

481
00:35:03,369 --> 00:35:04,468
Maksudnya apa?

482
00:35:04,470 --> 00:35:05,806
Tak diizinkan membuka pintu.

483
00:35:06,706 --> 00:35:07,972
Jadi maksudmu...

484
00:35:07,974 --> 00:35:11,744
dia bisa reboot kapal,
tapi tak bisa buka pintu sembarangan?

485
00:35:11,745 --> 00:35:13,713
Jelas itu bukan ruangan sembarangan.

486
00:35:17,083 --> 00:35:18,885
Ayo!

487
00:35:19,418 --> 00:35:20,619
Ayo!

488
00:35:38,071 --> 00:35:40,039
Tenang. 
Kita akan keluarkan mereka.

489
00:35:43,609 --> 00:35:46,814
Jika Andy tak bisa buka pintunya,
mungkin kita juga tak bisa.

490
00:35:47,948 --> 00:35:51,614
Dia sintetik Weyland-Yutani,
dan kita cuma penyusup.

491
00:35:52,752 --> 00:35:54,420
Ada ide lain?

492
00:35:54,955 --> 00:35:55,989
Belum.

493
00:35:58,792 --> 00:36:00,060
Kurasa di sini.

494
00:36:03,557 --> 00:36:04,591
Bjorn!

495
00:36:06,425 --> 00:36:07,461
Tyler!

496
00:36:11,865 --> 00:36:13,132
Mereka di dalam.

497
00:36:17,638 --> 00:36:18,870
Apa yang kau lakukan?

498
00:36:18,872 --> 00:36:22,941
Jika modul ini masih aktif,
aku bisa alihkan aksesnya ke Andy.

499
00:36:22,943 --> 00:36:25,711
Butuh akses lebih tinggi membuka pintu itu.

500
00:37:00,547 --> 00:37:02,281
Sial. Macet.

501
00:37:04,751 --> 00:37:06,720
Panas sekali di sini.

502
00:37:31,511 --> 00:37:32,579


503
00:37:34,346 --> 00:37:35,345
Gila.

504
00:37:35,347 --> 00:37:37,867
Jangan sentuh apa pun di sini.
/ Baik, Bu.

505
00:37:42,455 --> 00:37:43,822
Tolong! Tolong!

506
00:37:43,824 --> 00:37:44,956
Tidak!  Bagaimana ini?

507
00:37:44,958 --> 00:37:46,560
Modulnya.  Cabut!

508
00:37:52,032 --> 00:37:53,365
Kau tak apa?

509
00:37:54,668 --> 00:37:55,967
Gila, kacau.

510
00:37:55,969 --> 00:37:57,602
Ini.

511
00:37:57,604 --> 00:37:58,705
Kulihat.

512
00:38:00,607 --> 00:38:02,372
Ya, oke.

513
00:38:02,374 --> 00:38:03,541
Baik.

514
00:38:03,543 --> 00:38:05,543
- Berhasil!
- Hei.

515
00:38:05,545 --> 00:38:06,580
Rain.

516
00:38:07,781 --> 00:38:09,583
Ini dari sintetik itu.

517
00:38:10,784 --> 00:38:12,586
Pasang ke modul Andy.

518
00:38:16,790 --> 00:38:17,824
Maaf sekali.

519
00:38:18,859 --> 00:38:20,259
Ayo pergi dari sini.

520
00:38:21,795 --> 00:38:22,829
Andy?

521
00:38:25,499 --> 00:38:26,767
Baik, kita lihat.

522
00:38:30,003 --> 00:38:31,037
Oke.

523
00:38:35,407 --> 00:38:37,341
Sialan.

524
00:38:37,343 --> 00:38:39,443
Rain, apa aku salah?
Dia hanya terdiam.

525
00:38:39,445 --> 00:38:40,812
Dia memulai ulang.

526
00:38:40,814 --> 00:38:42,649
Butuh beberapa menit.

527
00:39:05,672 --> 00:39:07,406
Sini, biar kubantu jarimu.

528
00:39:15,381 --> 00:39:16,650
Apa itu tadi?

529
00:39:19,820 --> 00:39:21,387
Tunggu sebentar.

530
00:39:25,457 --> 00:39:26,493
Tyler?

531
00:39:31,064 --> 00:39:32,566
Apa yang kalian lakukan?

532
00:39:41,474 --> 00:39:43,541
Bjorn?

533
00:39:43,543 --> 00:39:44,876
Hentikan main-mainnya, bangunlah.

534
00:39:44,878 --> 00:39:45,944
Aku tidak main-main.

535
00:39:45,946 --> 00:39:46,911
Ada sesuatu di air.

536
00:39:46,913 --> 00:39:48,412
Apa maksudmu?
Apa itu?

537
00:39:48,414 --> 00:39:49,314
Aku tak tahu, apa itu.

538
00:39:49,316 --> 00:39:50,650
Ada sesuatu di air.

539
00:39:55,421 --> 00:39:56,455
Bjorn!

540
00:39:58,959 --> 00:40:00,925
Sialan!

541
00:40:00,927 --> 00:40:01,962
Apa sih itu?

542
00:40:07,567 --> 00:40:08,602
Andy!

543
00:40:10,804 --> 00:40:11,838
Bjorn!

544
00:40:18,078 --> 00:40:20,078
Bjorn, tolong dia! Lakukan sesuatu!

545
00:40:20,080 --> 00:40:21,179
Bjorn!

546
00:40:25,819 --> 00:40:27,487
- Tyler!
- Maafkan aku.

547
00:40:29,723 --> 00:40:31,055
Ayo!

548
00:40:31,057 --> 00:40:33,124
- Ayo! Bantu aku!
- Tidak, berhenti. Jangan...

549
00:40:33,126 --> 00:40:34,893
- Tidak! Navarro!
- Makhluk itu akan keluar.

550
00:40:34,895 --> 00:40:36,828
Kalau sampai masuk ke sini...

551
00:40:36,830 --> 00:40:37,964
- Jika mereka...
- Tidak!

552
00:40:41,835 --> 00:40:43,036
Sialan.

553
00:41:09,663 --> 00:41:11,164
Andy! Ayo!

554
00:41:13,466 --> 00:41:14,599
Pergi!  Bjorn!

555
00:41:14,601 --> 00:41:15,635
Andy, pintunya!

556
00:41:16,636 --> 00:41:17,769
- Bjorn!
- Ayo.

557
00:41:17,771 --> 00:41:18,805
Ayo, cepat!

558
00:41:21,241 --> 00:41:22,540
Keluar dari situ!

559
00:41:22,542 --> 00:41:23,608
Ayo, cepat!

560
00:41:23,610 --> 00:41:25,209
- Ayo, cepat!
- Pergi!

561
00:41:25,211 --> 00:41:26,646
Keluar dari situ!

562
00:41:29,983 --> 00:41:32,250
Cepat!

563
00:41:32,252 --> 00:41:34,585
- Bjorn, ayo!
- Pergi!

564
00:41:39,826 --> 00:41:41,161
Andy, pintunya!

565
00:41:50,170 --> 00:41:51,235
Jangan bergerak.

566
00:41:51,237 --> 00:41:53,004
Aku tahu!

567
00:41:54,908 --> 00:41:56,641
Makhluk itu mencekiknya.

568
00:41:56,643 --> 00:41:58,209
Berhenti! Hentikan!

569
00:41:58,211 --> 00:41:59,745
- Makhluk itu mencekiknya.
- Sial.

570
00:41:59,879 --> 00:42:01,579
Berhenti!  Bjorn!

571
00:42:01,581 --> 00:42:03,147
Bjorn, berhenti!
Astaga, berhenti!

572
00:42:03,149 --> 00:42:04,582
- Berhenti!
- Apa yang dilakukan makhluk itu?

573
00:42:04,584 --> 00:42:05,817
Makhluk itu membunuhnya?

574
00:42:05,819 --> 00:42:07,988
Kurasa makhluk itu tidak membunuhnya.

575
00:42:08,521 --> 00:42:09,556
Tidak.

576
00:42:09,923 --> 00:42:10,957
Andy?

577
00:42:12,625 --> 00:42:14,559
Dilihat dari kantung-kantung itu...

578
00:42:14,561 --> 00:42:16,928
yang mengembang sesuai dengan napasnya,

579
00:42:16,930 --> 00:42:20,098
kurasa makhluk itu memberinya oksigen
agar dia tetap hidup.

580
00:42:20,100 --> 00:42:21,968
Tujuannya apa, aku tak tahu.

581
00:42:23,737 --> 00:42:25,205
Maaf, kau siapa?

582
00:42:26,974 --> 00:42:30,241
Aku sintetik ND-255 Weyland-Yutani,

583
00:42:30,243 --> 00:42:32,645
awalnya untuk tugas tambang dan keselamatan.

584
00:42:33,713 --> 00:42:34,879
Kalian memanggilku Andy.

585
00:42:34,881 --> 00:42:36,116
Modul itu.

586
00:42:37,951 --> 00:42:38,985
Ya.

587
00:42:40,213 --> 00:42:42,681
Modul itu tidak hanya memperbarui hak aksesku.

588
00:42:42,683 --> 00:42:44,416
AI-ku diperbarui secara besar-besaran,

589
00:42:44,418 --> 00:42:47,220
dan kini sistem motorku diperbaiki.

590
00:42:48,388 --> 00:42:50,388
Pembaruan ini memang sudah lama tertunda.

591
00:42:50,390 --> 00:42:51,489
Akan kuhanguskan makhluk ini.

592
00:42:51,491 --> 00:42:52,591
- Tunggu.
- Jangan!

593
00:42:52,593 --> 00:42:54,225
- Kenapa?
- Arus sebesar itu....

594
00:42:54,227 --> 00:42:56,795
ekornya akan mengencang
dan mematahkan lehernya.

595
00:42:56,797 --> 00:42:58,296
Jadi ada ide lebih bagus?

596
00:42:58,298 --> 00:42:59,564
Kita harus bagaimana?

597
00:42:59,566 --> 00:43:01,433
Hei!

598
00:43:01,435 --> 00:43:03,270
Andy, bisa tolong dia?

599
00:43:04,271 --> 00:43:05,403
Sayangnya, databaseku...

600
00:43:05,405 --> 00:43:06,871
belum diperbarui.

601
00:43:06,873 --> 00:43:08,406
Aku tidak tahu makhluk ini...

602
00:43:08,408 --> 00:43:10,243
atau cara aman melepaskannya.

603
00:43:12,846 --> 00:43:14,881
Tapi ada yang tahu di ruangan ini.

604
00:43:45,412 --> 00:43:47,746
Aku harus amankan senyawa Z-01.

605
00:43:47,748 --> 00:43:49,748
Prioritas misi.
Semua prioritas lainnya dibatalkan.

606
00:43:49,750 --> 00:43:51,750
Misi harus selesai.

607
00:43:51,752 --> 00:43:53,251
Maaf...

608
00:43:53,253 --> 00:43:54,786
tapi misimu gagal.

609
00:43:54,788 --> 00:43:56,857
Apa? Tidak, aku...

610
00:44:02,396 --> 00:44:04,498
Bisa beritahu cara membantu dia?

611
00:44:05,666 --> 00:44:07,934
Jangan bantu dia.
Larilah.

612
00:44:08,802 --> 00:44:10,802
Keluar, jalan yang kau masuki tadi.

613
00:44:10,804 --> 00:44:12,537
Tidak. Tunggu.

614
00:44:12,539 --> 00:44:14,706
Kita tak akan meninggalkannya.
Mengerti?

615
00:44:14,708 --> 00:44:17,475
Jika kasihan, bunuh dia sekarang.

616
00:44:17,477 --> 00:44:20,280
Jika tidak, kalian semua mati.

617
00:44:22,349 --> 00:44:23,915
Apa maksudnya?

618
00:44:23,917 --> 00:44:25,450
Mahkluk itu apakan dia?

619
00:44:25,452 --> 00:44:26,618
Parasitoid itu memasukkan...

620
00:44:26,620 --> 00:44:28,386
Plagiarus Praepotens di tubuhnya.

621
00:44:28,388 --> 00:44:29,654
Maaf, apa?

622
00:44:29,656 --> 00:44:33,827
Benih yang akan menyatu dengan DNA-nya
dan tumbuh cepat keluar dari tubuhnya.

623
00:44:33,827 --> 00:44:35,895
Apa yang akan keluar dari tubuhnya?

624
00:44:46,940 --> 00:44:49,810
XX121 Xenomorph.

625
00:44:50,677 --> 00:44:55,482
20 tahun lalu, kapal penarik kami
menemukan makhluk ini.

626
00:44:55,482 --> 00:44:56,514
Dari 7 kru di USS Nostromo,

627
00:44:56,516 --> 00:44:58,883
hanya satu yang selamat,

628
00:44:58,885 --> 00:45:01,753
setelah melempar makhluk itu keluar angkasa.

629
00:45:01,755 --> 00:45:04,656
Kami terus mencarinya sejak itu.

630
00:45:04,658 --> 00:45:07,992
170 hari lalu, pencarian kami berakhir...

631
00:45:07,994 --> 00:45:10,263
saat tubuh Xenomorph ditemukan
dan dibawa ke kapal,

632
00:45:10,764 --> 00:45:12,497
di duga mati.

633
00:45:12,499 --> 00:45:13,698
Tentu,

634
00:45:13,700 --> 00:45:17,869
kurangnya oksigen
dan makanan tidak berpengaruh bagi...

635
00:45:17,871 --> 00:45:19,537
makhluk sempurna ini.

636
00:45:19,539 --> 00:45:21,575
Tapi tak ada yang benar-benar abadi.

637
00:45:23,343 --> 00:45:24,776
Jelas.

638
00:45:24,778 --> 00:45:28,279
Mahkluk itu menghancurkan stasiun ini,

639
00:45:28,281 --> 00:45:30,882
sampai keamanan terakhir kami menembaknya mati.

640
00:45:30,884 --> 00:45:33,587
Malah membuatnya mati dengan tragis.

641
00:45:34,588 --> 00:45:35,720
Darah asam?

642
00:45:35,722 --> 00:45:37,622
Sulfat dan fluorida.

643
00:45:37,624 --> 00:45:39,491
Aku sudah menutup stasiunnya,
tapi sudah terlambat.

644
00:45:39,493 --> 00:45:40,759
Diam!

645
00:45:40,761 --> 00:45:42,560
Tak ada yang peduli lagi soal kapalmu.

646
00:45:42,562 --> 00:45:44,429
Oke.

647
00:45:44,431 --> 00:45:46,598
Kalau kita bekukan akar ekornya...

648
00:45:46,600 --> 00:45:49,367
pakai bahan bakar cryo?

649
00:45:49,369 --> 00:45:52,272
Jika dibekukan, mungkin dia takkan mencekiknya.

650
00:45:53,440 --> 00:45:54,774
Mungkin berhasil.

651
00:46:23,537 --> 00:46:24,871
Ayo, lepaskan!

652
00:46:46,626 --> 00:46:48,626
Sudah pergi.
Sudah terlepas darimu.

653
00:46:49,996 --> 00:46:51,830
Sudah lepas.

654
00:46:51,832 --> 00:46:53,598
Kau aman.

655
00:46:53,600 --> 00:46:54,901
Aku tak yakin.

656
00:47:00,473 --> 00:47:01,606
Seberapa besar peluangnya?

657
00:47:01,608 --> 00:47:04,008
Peluang hidup temanmu hanya 40%.

658
00:47:04,010 --> 00:47:04,978
Peluang apanya?

659
00:47:07,013 --> 00:47:09,015
Jika makhluk itu sudah menyelesaikan tugasnya.

660
00:47:11,152 --> 00:47:12,586
Apa maksud dia?

661
00:47:14,454 --> 00:47:15,920
Dengarkan.

662
00:47:15,922 --> 00:47:18,656
Manusia pasti menghadapi banyak emosi...

663
00:47:18,658 --> 00:47:20,792
sebelum bisa menerima kenyataan...

664
00:47:20,794 --> 00:47:23,095
yang rasional-meski itu yang tersulit.

665
00:47:23,097 --> 00:47:25,030
Kau harus bantu mereka.

666
00:47:25,032 --> 00:47:26,165
Kau harus bantu mereka.

667
00:47:31,438 --> 00:47:32,472
Andy?

668
00:47:33,440 --> 00:47:34,572
- Ada apa?
- Maaf,

669
00:47:34,574 --> 00:47:36,041
tapi dia tak bisa kembali ke kapal.

670
00:47:36,043 --> 00:47:37,976
- Ya? Ini masalah.
- Apa maksudmu?

671
00:47:37,978 --> 00:47:39,178
- Kau harus mengerti.
- Lihat?

672
00:47:39,180 --> 00:47:40,179
Ini maksudku soal "ide gila" itu!

673
00:47:40,181 --> 00:47:42,580
Maksudmu apa? Tidak, dia...

674
00:47:42,582 --> 00:47:44,083
- Tidak!
- Dasar brengsek!

675
00:47:44,085 --> 00:47:45,583
Hei! Andy!

676
00:47:45,585 --> 00:47:46,718
Kita pergi.

677
00:47:46,720 --> 00:47:47,952
Hei! Aku di sini.

678
00:47:47,954 --> 00:47:49,589
Ayo, cepat.

679
00:47:51,725 --> 00:47:52,857
Tyler! Ayo, cepat!

680
00:47:52,859 --> 00:47:53,725
- Aku di sini.
- Bjorn! Tidak.

681
00:47:53,727 --> 00:47:55,894
Bjorn, jangan tinggalkan mereka!

682
00:47:55,896 --> 00:47:57,062
- Aku di sini.
- Bjorn!

683
00:47:59,166 --> 00:48:00,832
- Mana mereka?
- Dengarkan.

684
00:48:00,834 --> 00:48:01,933
Kita harus nyalakan kapalnya.

685
00:48:01,935 --> 00:48:03,102
- Cepat nyalakan kapalnya.
- Mana Rain? Bagaimana...

686
00:48:03,104 --> 00:48:05,037
Maafkan aku.

687
00:48:05,039 --> 00:48:07,605
Aku cuma jadi bebanmu.

688
00:48:07,607 --> 00:48:10,775
Sekarang, akhirnya aku bisa membantu.

689
00:48:10,777 --> 00:48:13,080
Kau takkan menganggapku anak kecil lagi.

690
00:48:15,082 --> 00:48:16,117
Apa?

691
00:48:16,917 --> 00:48:18,016
Andy!

692
00:48:27,661 --> 00:48:28,695
- Hei!
- Bjorn!

693
00:48:52,219 --> 00:48:53,453
Sialan.

694
00:48:53,954 --> 00:48:55,553
Navarro, lepaskan!

695
00:48:55,555 --> 00:48:56,723
Lepaskan kapalnya!

696
00:48:59,492 --> 00:49:01,926
Pelepasan kapal dimulai.

697
00:49:01,928 --> 00:49:04,595
Harap lepaskan ruang kedap udara.

698
00:49:16,576 --> 00:49:17,709
Apa yang dia lakukan?

699
00:49:17,711 --> 00:49:18,977
Mereka tak boleh pergi tanpa kita.

700
00:49:18,979 --> 00:49:20,847
Dia kira Andy mau membunuh Navarro.

701
00:49:22,549 --> 00:49:23,583
Apa?

702
00:49:24,818 --> 00:49:25,952
Benarkah?

703
00:49:29,823 --> 00:49:30,991
Aku tak tahu.

704
00:49:34,295 --> 00:49:36,594
Andy?

705
00:49:37,831 --> 00:49:38,999
Andy, buka pintunya.

706
00:49:44,904 --> 00:49:47,640
Maaf, aku tak bisa hentikan mereka.

707
00:49:48,641 --> 00:49:49,640
Bjorn?

708
00:49:49,642 --> 00:49:50,875
Bjorn, apa yang kau lakukan?

709
00:49:50,877 --> 00:49:53,112
Jangan tinggalkan kami di sini.
Jemput kami kembali.

710
00:49:53,114 --> 00:49:55,849
Maaf, aku tak bisa
sebelum dia menghentikan psikopat itu.

711
00:49:58,018 --> 00:49:59,284
Ada apa?

712
00:49:59,286 --> 00:50:00,620
Andy...

713
00:50:02,123 --> 00:50:04,989
- Andy, dia rusak.
- Apa?

714
00:50:04,991 --> 00:50:05,957
Aku harus menjauh...

715
00:50:05,959 --> 00:50:07,560
dari ruang udara ini sekarang.

716
00:50:09,729 --> 00:50:10,862
Navarro?

717
00:50:10,864 --> 00:50:12,830
Kau tak apa?

718
00:50:12,832 --> 00:50:14,133
Ada apa? Kau butuh apa?

719
00:50:20,774 --> 00:50:21,808
Navarro?

720
00:50:30,717 --> 00:50:31,983
Ya Tuhan.

721
00:50:31,985 --> 00:50:33,686
Astaga, itu apa?

722
00:50:36,890 --> 00:50:38,856
Navarro, kumohon.
Navarro!

723
00:50:38,858 --> 00:50:40,192
Hei.

724
00:50:41,195 --> 00:50:43,330
Aku tak tahu harus bagaimana, maaf.
Aku bingung.

725
00:50:49,303 --> 00:50:50,269
Siapa saja bicaralah!

726
00:50:50,271 --> 00:50:52,639
Kay, Bjorn, Navarro, ada apa?

727
00:51:03,084 --> 00:51:04,118
Tolong!

728
00:51:05,018 --> 00:51:06,353
- Tolong!
- Kay!

729
00:51:07,654 --> 00:51:10,224
Apa yang terjadi?

730
00:51:12,725 --> 00:51:14,694
Tolong jangan biarkan aku mati.

731
00:51:17,398 --> 00:51:18,729
Siapa saja tolong!

732
00:53:03,598 --> 00:53:04,632
Bjorn?

733
00:53:04,966 --> 00:53:06,297
Kay?

734
00:53:06,299 --> 00:53:08,199
Kita harus jemput mereka.

735
00:53:08,201 --> 00:53:13,240
